            "review_title": "Review at Ru - Brunch, Dinner, Wine",
            "review_text": "Setra\n2 contributions\n0\nFirst time in Ru\nMay 2026 • Solo\nHad a really lovely experience at this wine bar in Da Nang. The atmosphere was cozy and relaxing, with warm lighting and a comfortable vibe that made it easy to unwind after a long day.\n\nThe wine selection was surprisingly good, offering both approachable bottles and more interesting choices for people who enjoy exploring different styles. What stood out the most was the staff — very knowledgeable and genuinely passionate about wine without being pushy. Their recommendation paired perfectly with the food and made the whole experience even better.\n\nThe music was soft, the environment felt intimate, and it was the kind of place where you could enjoy a proper conversation over a glass of wine. Definitely one of the nicer spots in Da Nang if you’re looking for something more refined and relaxed. Will absolutely come back to try more from their wine list\nRead more\nWritten May 15, 2026",
